    "reads": {
      "front": "The jet comes straight at the far target from just beside the camera: a bright flare at the hand, a short, fat-looking column foreshortened toward the target, and the splash of billows and sparks blooming at the far end.",
      "side": "Hero view. The whole jet in profile: a tight white-yellow column leaving the hand, widening only a little and reddening toward the target, surges pulsing down it, and a splash of flame and sparks where it breaks on the target.",
      "top": "A narrow straight line of fire from the caster to the target, its far end splashing into a round bloom; the ground story carries the hit: a hot burn patch that cools to a small scorch under the target, and sparks spraying out around it.",
      "three_quarter": "The jet reads as a tight column receding toward the target with the splash rising off it; the scorch reads as an ellipse under the target."
    }
